---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ASCEND Team Login
description: Sign in to your ASCEND team workspace.
permalink: /data/team/
dataApp: team
---
<div class="container data-page" id="team-portal" data-api="{{ dataExplorer.apiBase }}" data-clerk-key="{{ dataExplorer.clerkKey }}" data-clerk-domain="{{ dataExplorer.clerkDomain }}" data-clerk-proxy-path="{{ dataExplorer.clerkProxyPath }}">
 <span class="eyebrow">ASCEND · Team workspace</span>
 <h1>Member workspace</h1>
 <p class="lead">Sign in with your own ASCEND account. Your team and role are assigned by an administrator.</p>
 <div class="data-actions"><a href="/community/">ASCEND on Zulip</a><a href="/data/">Public Data Explorer</a></div>
 <p id="team-status" class="data-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading sign-in…</p>
 <div id="team-sign-in"></div>
 <section id="team-account" hidden><h2 id="team-name">Your account</h2><div id="team-user-button"></div><p id="team-role"></p></section>
 <form id="enrollment-form" class="data-mapping" hidden><h2>Request ASCEND membership</h2><p>A moderator or administrator must approve your account before you can create missions or upload data.</p><label>Your name<input name="display_name" required maxlength="80"></label><label>School or project affiliation<input name="affiliation" maxlength="200"></label><button class="button" type="submit">Request membership</button></form>
 <section id="membership-review" class="membership-review" hidden><h2>Membership requests</h2><p>Approving grants ordinary membership. An administrator then assigns a team so the member can upload data.</p><div id="membership-requests"></div></section>
 <section id="team-workspace" hidden>
 <div class="data-actions"><a href="/data/upload/?team=1">Upload a CSV to my team</a></div>
 <h2>Create a mission</h2><p>Validated uploads become publicly available automatically. Use a separate mission for each flight; confirm the data license before uploading.</p>
 <form id="mission-form" class="data-mapping">
 <label>Mission name<input name="name" required maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Mission date<input name="mission_date" type="date" required></label>
 <label>Faculty mentor / investigator<input name="principal_investigator" maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Data license<select name="data_license" required><option value="">Choose a license</option><option value="CC0-1.0">CC0 — public domain dedication</option><option value="CC-BY-4.0">CC BY 4.0 — attribution required</option><option value="All rights reserved">All rights reserved</option></select></label>
 <label>Platform type<select name="platform_type" required><option value="hab">High-altitude balloon</option><option value="fixed_wing_uas">Fixed-wing UAS</option><option value="multirotor_uas">Multirotor UAS</option><option value="radiosonde">Radiosonde</option><option value="ground_station">Ground station</option></select></label>
 <label>Platform name<input name="platform_name" required maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Sensor / logger name<input name="sensor_name" required maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Sensor / logger model<input name="sensor_model" maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="4000"></textarea></label>
 <label class="data-checkbox"><input name="synthetic" type="checkbox">Synthetic test mission (no real observations)</label>
 <button class="button" type="submit">Create mission</button>
 </form>
 <p id="mission-status" class="data-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
 <h2>My missions</h2><div id="my-missions"></div>
 <h2>My uploads</h2><div id="my-uploads"></div>
 </section>
 <section id="administrator-workspace" hidden>
 <h2>Manage teams</h2>
 <p>Create the team's email/password user in Clerk, then assign its User ID here. No invitations are sent by this form.</p>
 <form id="team-create-form" class="data-mapping">
 <label>Institution<input name="institution" required maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Team name<input name="name" required maxlength="160"></label>
 <label>Clerk User ID<input name="subject" required maxlength="255" pattern="user_[A-Za-z0-9]+"></label>
 <button type="submit" class="button">Create team and assign login</button>
 </form>
 <p id="administrator-status" class="data-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div id="administrator-teams"></div>
 <h2>Manage members and roles</h2><p>Each person uses an individual Clerk login. Assign multiple members to a team. The project owner can assign up to 12 helper administrators.</p>
 <form id="member-form" class="data-mapping"><label>Clerk User ID<input name="subject" required maxlength="255" pattern="user_[A-Za-z0-9]+"></label><label>Display name<input name="display_name" required maxlength="80"></label><label>Team<select name="team_id" id="member-team"></select></label><label>Role<select name="role"><option value="member">Member</option><option value="moderator">Moderator</option><option value="administrator">Administrator</option></select></label><label class="data-checkbox"><input name="active" type="checkbox" checked>Active membership</label><button type="submit" class="button">Save member</button></form><div id="administrator-members"></div>
 <h2>Public data management</h2>
 <p>Successful validated uploads are public automatically. Withdraw erroneous datasets here; withdrawal also blocks further uploads to that mission until restored.</p>
 <div id="administrator-missions"></div>
 <h2>Import verification</h2><div id="administrator-files"></div>
 </section>
 <noscript><p>Team sign-in requires JavaScript.</p></noscript>
</div>
